# Design notes — Master Admin Entity Management

## Default tab and hash

- Parent **Entity Management** opens **Manage Entities** (`data-default-panel="entityManagement"`).
- URL hash must be `#entityManagement`, never `#clubAdminUrls` for that parent click.
- Subtabs keep their own hashes: `#clubAdminUrls`, `#allQueues`, `#clubOnboarding`, `#templateManagement`, `#recommendationModeration`.

## Shared-link resume (all Entity Management panels)

1. Unauthenticated deep link → Master Admin sign-in (Google/Microsoft). Persist intended panel (`floqr_master_admin_deeplink`) so Microsoft redirect does not lose the hash.
2. After primary auth → resume the hashed panel.
3. Panel stays behind **SOS2FA** until Verify & unlock; then show gated content.

Same order for every Entity Management subtab. Security / Reports / Diagnostics groups are separate (not SOS2FA Entity Management).

## Help vs this file

Privilege Admin Access `?` help is SOS2FA how-to only. Do **not** put this hash/resume essay in served help — keep it here.
